    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified for the information of the pilgrims who attend the above festival and other concerned that theabove festival commences on 06.07.2017 with the schedule of execution of duties to the manes on 23.07.2017. Alsothe festivals terminate on 25.07.2017 with the \"Vairavar Pooja\".",
